===Definitions===
{{head|zh|hanzi}} {{tlb|zh|Cantonese}}

# to [[come]]; to [[arrive]]
#: {{zh-x|我 想 嚟 探{taam3} 你。|I'd like to '''come''' and visit you.|C}}
# to [[bring]]
#: {{zh-x|嚟 多 一 碗 叉燒 飯。|'''Bring''' me another bowl of rice with barbecue pork.|C}}
# [[to]]; [[for]] {{gl|expresses purpose}}
#: {{zh-x|我 買 咗 啲 雞蛋{daan6-2} 嚟 整 蛋撻{taat1}。|I bought some eggs '''to''' make egg tarts.|C}}
# {{n-g|Used to indicate that an event has just occurred}}
#: {{zh-x|你 睇 完 戲 嚟 呀{aa4}？|Did you '''just''' watch a movie?|C}}
#* {{zh-x|你 去 邊處{cyu3} '''黎'''|Where have you been?|C|ref='''1828''', Robert Morrison, ''Vocabulary of the Canton Dialect'', part III, section I}}
# {{n-g|Used to emphasize that the identity of the subject is the object}}
#: {{zh-x|邊個 嚟 㗎？|Who is this?|C}}
#: {{zh-x|咩 嚟？|{{q|highly informal}} What's that?|C}}
#: {{zh-x|呢{ni1} 隻 係 狗 嚟 嘅。|This is a dog.|C}}
#: {{zh-x|貓 嚟 㗎。|It's a cat.|C}}
#: {{zh-x|佢 工程師 嚟 㗎。|They are an engineer.|C}}
#* {{quote-av|yue|year=1952|director=潘炳權|writer=唐龍|title=契爺艷史<t:Foster-Daddy's Romantic Affairs>|url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e-AbQgPLOMI&t=5504|actor=w:zh:羅劍郎|role=梁劍雲}}
#*: {{zh-q|我 唔係 你 雲 哥，我 係 呢度 嘅 顧客 嚟{lei4}。|I am not your Big Brother Wan; I am a customer here.|C}}
#* {{quote-book|zh|year=2017|author=小婉婉|title=zh:《P牌社工蝦碌碌：社福界小薯仔嘅讀書＋實習手記》|location=Hong Kong|publisher=非凡出版社|isbn=9789888488247|page=43|pageurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20210726034357/https://www.chunghwabook.com.hk/Public/files/upload/9789888488247.pdf}}
#*: {{zh-q|如果 問 我 社工 係 咩 嚟，我 會 覺{gok3}得 好似 一 個「補給站」。|If you ask me what a social worker is, I would think it is like a depot.|C}}
# {{n-g|Used before a verb to express volition.}}
#: {{zh-x|等 我 嚟 做 啦。|Wait for me to do it.|C}}
# {{lb|zh|of events}} to [[occur]]

====Usage notes====
* Cantonese {{lang|zh|嚟}} is the direct equivalent of Modern Standard Chinese's {{zh-l|來}}, but there are some fixed phrases where {{lang|zh|來}} cannot be substituted with {{lang|zh|嚟}}. For example, {{zh-l|出來}} is equivalent to {{zh-l|出嚟}} but {{zh-l|原來如此}} cannot become *{{lang|zh|原嚟如此}}.

